<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Nobrim handles information shared through this website." lang="en"><section><div class="container narrow"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><h2>Information shared through the website</h2><p>The contact form does not store information on this website. When submitted, it opens a WhatsApp message so the conversation can continue through that channel.</p><h2>Purpose</h2><p>Information shared is used only to respond to the requested contact, schedule conversations and present Nobrim's services.</p><h2>Your rights</h2><p>To request information, updates or deletion of shared data, email <a href="mailto:contato@nobrim.com.br">contato@nobrim.com.br</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout><style>.narrow{max-width:800px}section{padding:var(--space-10) 0}</style>
